msgctxt "[\"3D-Slicer\",\"sv-reviewed-20260918\",\"VectorToScalarVolume\\n\",\"VectorToScalarVolume:8\",\"00ac11f1fb1de4de9dd7c834\"]"
msgid ""
"\n"
"    <p>Make a scalar (1 component) volume from a vector volume.</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>It provides multiple conversion modes:</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"    <li>extract single components from any vector image.</li>\n"
"    <li>convert RGB images to scalar using luminance as implemented in vtkImageLuminance (scalar = 0.30*R + 0.59*G + 0.11*B).</li>\n"
"    <li>computes the mean of all the components.</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    <p>Skapa en skalär volym (1 komponent) från en vektorvolym.</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <p>Det ger flera konverteringslägen:</p>\n"
"\n"
"    <ul>\n"
"    <li>extrahera enstaka komponenter från valfri vektorbild.</li>\n"
"    <li>konvertera RGB-bilder till skalär med hjälp av luminans som implementeras i vtkImageLuminance (skalär = 0,30*R + 0,59*G + 0,11*B).</li>\n"
"    <li>beräknar medelvärdet av alla komponenter.</li>\n"
"    </ul>\n"
"    "

