msgctxt "[\"3D-Slicer\",\"sv-reviewed-20260918\",\"SegmentEditorEffects.SegmentEditorFillBetweenSlicesEffect\\n\",\"SegmentEditorEffects.SegmentEditorFillBetweenSlicesEffect:1\",\"6a3853a9783a926abdc224af\"]"
msgid ""
"Interpolate segmentation between slices<br>. Instructions:\n"
"<p><ul>\n"
"<li>Create complete segmentation on selected slices using any editor effect.\n"
"Segmentation will only expanded if a slice is segmented but none of the direct neighbors are segmented, therefore\n"
"do not use sphere brush with Paint effect and always leave at least one empty slice between segmented slices.\n"
"<li>All visible segments will be interpolated, not just the selected segment.\n"
"<li>The complete segmentation will be created by interpolating segmentations in empty slices.\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"Masking settings are ignored. If segments overlap, segment higher in the segments table will have priority.\n"
"The effect uses  <a href=\"https://insight-journal.org/browse/publication/977\">morphological contour interpolation method</a>.\n"
"<p>"
msgstr ""
"Interpolera segmenteringen mellan skivorna<br>. Instruktioner:\n"
"<p><ul>\n"
"<li>Skapa fullständig segmentering på utvalda skivor med hjälp av valfri redigeringseffekt.\n"
"Segmenteringen kommer bara att utvidgas om en skiva är segmenterad men ingen av de direkta grannarna är segmenterade, därför\n"
"använd inte sfärborste med Paint-effekt och lämna alltid minst en tom skiva mellan segmenterade skivor.\n"
"<li>Alla synliga segment interpoleras, inte bara det valda segmentet.\n"
"<li>Den fullständiga segmenteringen skapas genom interpolering av segmenteringar i tomma skivor.\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"Maskeringsinställningar ignoreras. Om segmenten överlappar varandra prioriteras det segment som ligger högre upp i segmenttabellen.\n"
"Effekten använder <a href=\"https://insight-journal.org/browse/publication/977\">morfologisk konturinterpolationsmetod</a>.\n"
"<p>"

