msgid "If checked, then photometric interpretation of JPEG-compressed ultrasound will be set to YBR_FULL_422. This is useful for fixing inconsistency in JPEG-compressed images that used RGB as photometric interpretation due to ambiguity in the DICOM standard before CP156. See https://groups.google.com/g/comp.protocols.dicom/c/EPkbFOMBOhE and https://dicom.nema.org/medical/dicom/Final/cp156_ft.pdf for more details."
