msgctxt "[\"3D-Slicer\",\"sv-reviewed-20260918\",\"SegmentEditorEffects.SegmentEditorLogicalEffect\\n\",\"SegmentEditorEffects.SegmentEditorLogicalEffect:1\",\"e03970ebac87eaa5d5366a9d\"]"
msgid ""
"Apply logical operators or combine segments<br>. Available operations:<p>\n"
"<ul style=\"margin: 0\">\n"
"<li><b>Copy:</b> replace the selected segment by the modifier segment.\n"
"<li><b>Add:</b> add modifier segment to current segment.\n"
"<li><b>Subtract:</b> subtract region of modifier segment from the selected segment.\n"
"<li><b>Intersect:</b> only keeps those regions in the select segment that are common with the modifier segment.\n"
"<li><b>Invert:</b> inverts selected segment.\n"
"<li><b>Clear:</b> clears selected segment.\n"
"<li><b>Fill:</b> completely fills selected segment.\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"<b>Selected segment:</b> segment selected in the segment list - above. <b>Modifier segment:</b> segment chosen in\n"
"segment list in effect options - below.\n"
"<p>"
msgstr ""
"Använd logiska operatorer eller kombinera segment<br>. Tillgängliga operationer:<p>\n"
"<ul style=\"margin: 0\">\n"
"<li><b>Copy:</b> ersätt det valda segmentet med modifieringssegmentet.\n"
"<li><b>Add:</b> lägg till modifieringssegmentet till det aktuella segmentet.\n"
"<li><b>Subtrahera: sub</b> trahera regionen i det modifierande segmentet från det valda segmentet.\n"
"<li><b>Intersect:</b> behåller endast de regioner i det markerade segmentet som är gemensamma med det modifierande segmentet.\n"
"<li><b>Invert: in</b> verterar<b>det</b> valda segmentet.\n"
"<li><b>Clear:</b> rensar valt segment.\n"
"<li><b>Fill:</b> fyller det valda segmentet helt.\n"
"</ul><p>\n"
"<b>Selected</b> segment<b>:</b> segment som valts i segmentlistan - ovan. <b>Modifier</b> segment <b>:</b> segment valt i\n"
"segmentlistan i effektalternativen - nedan.\n"
"<p>"

