msgid "A mrml file that contains a template model hierarchy tree with a hierarchy node per color used in the input volume's color table. Color names used for the models are matched to template hierarchy names to create a multi level output tree. Create a hierarchy in the Models GUI and save a scene, then clean it up to remove everything but the model hierarchy and display nodes."
